III.

That the Central Depository Services Ltd. (CDSL) and National Securities Depository Ltd. (NSDL) is directed that securities owned/held by the Respondents (except companies) in any company/society be frozen, and be prohibited from being transferred or alienation and details thereof be shared with the Petitioner;

