21. (1) The Funds of the Trust may be invested in short or long term deposits to yield better returns if feasible after keeping sufficient balance at the disposal of Trust or in such manner as the Board may authorise.

(2) The Chief Executive Officer shall maintain a register of securities held by the Trust.

